00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.496
- We start off with a
really nice New York bagel.

00:08:59.496 --> 00:09:02.216
Then I take mascarpone and cream cheese

00:09:02.216 --> 00:09:03.247
and I whip that together.

00:09:03.247 --> 00:09:04.685
So we smeared it onto the bagel

00:09:04.685 --> 00:09:05.906
and then we have the truffle which is

00:09:05.906 --> 00:09:07.786
the main important ingredient on it.

00:09:07.786 --> 00:09:09.786
So we have nice white
truffles, we shave those thin.

00:09:09.786 --> 00:09:11.626
Then I use goji berry jelly.

00:09:11.626 --> 00:09:13.316
So I think decent wine and goji berries,

00:09:13.316 --> 00:09:14.956
coming together, pureed up a little bit,

00:09:14.956 --> 00:09:16.898
thicken it up and then
make that into the jelly.

00:09:16.898 --> 00:09:19.047
Goes great with truffle,
the pungent of the truffle

00:09:19.047 --> 00:09:20.546
and sweetness of the jelly.

00:09:20.546 --> 00:09:22.876
Then we have a little gold leaf
for a little bit of pizazz.

00:09:22.876 --> 00:09:25.018
It kind of just, heightens
up the color a little bit.

00:09:25.018 --> 00:09:26.396
(register bell)

00:09:26.396 --> 00:09:28.827
- I have eaten more truffle in my life,

00:09:28.827 --> 00:09:30.556
in the last year because of Worth It.

00:09:30.556 --> 00:09:32.698
So people always ask me what is truffle,

00:09:32.698 --> 00:09:35.076
smell like like it's hard to describe.

00:09:35.076 --> 00:09:37.367
- It's kind of like how, why do we enjoy

00:09:37.367 --> 00:09:39.679
eating spicy food if it's hurting us,

00:09:39.679 --> 00:09:41.498
but I think the best spicy food is

00:09:41.498 --> 00:09:44.567
right on the edge of delicious and pain.

00:09:44.567 --> 00:09:46.828
And truffle is right on the edge of

00:09:46.828 --> 00:09:50.647
delicious smelling and quite
frankly nasty smelling.

00:09:50.647 --> 00:09:54.458
But it's riding that line
where, it's the best smell.

00:09:54.458 --> 00:09:56.207
- To me, when I first smelled truffle.

00:09:56.207 --> 00:09:59.085
It smells bad, initially,
but then it's like,

00:09:59.085 --> 00:10:01.490
the more you smell it the better it gets.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.323
- Yeah.

00:10:02.323 --> 00:10:03.338
- We'll eat together alright.

00:10:03.338 --> 00:10:04.250
- Okay.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.450
Bagel cheers.

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:06.456
- Cheers.

00:10:06.456 --> 00:10:09.123
(soft keyboard)

00:10:13.867 --> 00:10:14.867
Solid bagel.

00:10:15.707 --> 00:10:17.056
- That is really tasty.

00:10:17.056 --> 00:10:19.336
I would never guess that jelly,

00:10:19.336 --> 00:10:22.467
and a mushroomy thing, would
taste really good together.

00:10:22.467 --> 00:10:23.964
You don't really encounter that often.

00:10:23.964 --> 00:10:24.797
- Yeah.

00:10:24.797 --> 00:10:26.947
Wow, I'm surprised, the jelly just like,

00:10:26.947 --> 00:10:31.886
cancels out a lot of the
really weird funk pungentness.

00:10:31.886 --> 00:10:32.719
- Like a dank.

00:10:32.719 --> 00:10:34.387
- And it really brings out the nice,

00:10:34.387 --> 00:10:36.856
colorful, dank flavor of the truffle.

00:10:36.856 --> 00:10:38.638
- Of all the truffle things I've had

00:10:38.638 --> 00:10:40.644
this is actually top two maybe.

00:10:40.644 --> 00:10:42.398
- I think this is a good truffle food.

00:10:42.398 --> 00:10:44.427
For people who actually don't know

00:10:44.427 --> 00:10:45.686
if they like truffles or not.

00:10:45.686 --> 00:10:49.450
It's a good gateway, it's a truffle dove.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:52.033
(upbeat music)

00:10:54.736 --> 00:10:56.078
- Alright who's your
worth it winner Andrew?

00:10:56.078 --> 00:10:58.627
- My worth it winner is Utopia Bagels.

00:10:58.627 --> 00:11:01.395
I can't find a fault in their bagels.

00:11:01.395 --> 00:11:05.087
- For me I so wanna pick
the Jerusalem bagel but I,

00:11:05.087 --> 00:11:07.436
it's this close, but it goes to Utopia.

00:11:07.436 --> 00:11:08.407
- [Andrew] Yeah.

00:11:08.407 --> 00:11:10.215
- The Utopia Bagel's my worth it winner.

00:11:10.215 --> 00:11:12.357
I realize that I did not
know what a bagel was.

00:11:12.357 --> 00:11:15.055
I've grown up today, I hit bagel puberty.

00:11:15.055 --> 00:11:15.888
- Whoa

00:11:15.888 --> 00:11:18.765
- And I learned what bagels are.

00:11:18.765 --> 00:11:21.615
- Hey Adam what's your worth it winner.

00:11:21.615 --> 00:11:23.245
Bar Bolanat, Adam picks Bar Bolonat

00:11:23.245 --> 00:11:25.122
- Whoa.
- Yeah.

00:11:25.122 --> 00:11:26.954
- I saw that a mile away.

00:11:26.954 --> 00:11:30.023
This is something I sorely
miss in Los Angeles.

00:11:30.023 --> 00:11:31.434
I think people just don't get it.

00:11:31.434 --> 00:11:32.765
Like there's too much sunshine,

00:11:32.765 --> 00:11:36.994
they don't crave the comfort
of a warm bready thing,

00:11:36.994 --> 00:11:40.503
because they don't have that
deep sadness that you need.

00:11:40.503 --> 00:11:41.823
- You sayin that New York's a sad city?

00:11:41.823 --> 00:11:43.173
- It's just a theory.

00:11:43.173 --> 00:11:45.954
It's just like winter,
the anger, the honking.

00:11:45.954 --> 00:11:47.537
- [Steven] Oh yes!

